# CozyVTT EPURE Agent Orchestration

This repository is a TypeScript Node/Express + Prisma backend and a React/Vite
frontend governed by EPURE (`Giskard-AI/epure`). See `AGENTS.md`, `GLOSSARY.md`,
`DESIGN.md`, and `docs/adr/0019-epure-governance-and-multi-agent-orchestration.md`.

## Governance & Command Flow

- **Issue Commands (`epure-issue-command.yml`)**: Write collaborators run `/epure plan` on a feature issue to generate a specification PR (`plan/*`) reviewed by `design-reviewer` and `user-advocate` in `design-gate` mode, then `/epure approve` to materialize the child task DAG on `feature/<id>-<slug>` and dispatch implementation agents.
- **Repository Bootstrap (`/setup-repo`)**: `.agents/skills/setup-repo/SKILL.md` configures `.github/agents.yml`, caller workflows, squash-only merge settings, the 12-agent `.cursor/agents/*.md` reviewer roster, and the 3 Repository Rulesets (`epure-feature-governance`, `epure-dev-governance`, `epure-release-immutability`).
- **Blocking Multi-Agent Review (`ai-review`)**: Every pull request targeting `feature/**`, `dev`, or `main` runs `epure-check.yml` (`ai-review`), which selects the applicable readonly reviewers from `.cursor/agents/*.md` based on changed paths and blocks merge on any `must_fix` finding.

## Readonly Reviewer Roster (`.cursor/agents/*.md`)

- **Domain & Stack Specialists**:
  - `domain-backend-reviewer` — Express 5 routes, services, middleware, Zod validators, `RevokedLoginSession` fail-closed session revocation, platform/campaign RBAC, Multer + magic-byte uploads, Prisma transactions, and `routeInventory.test.ts`.
  - `realtime-reviewer` (`paths: backend/src/websocket, frontend/src/stores/gameStore.ts, frontend/src/components/campaign/map, frontend/src/services/socket.ts`) — Socket session/campaign auth, map mutex locking (`withMapsLocked`), fog of war, dynamic lighting raycasting, spirit layer/realm filtering, and `websocket-events.py --check`.
  - `game-systems-reviewer` (`paths: backend/src/game-systems, backend/src/validators/game-systems, frontend/src/components/character-sheets, frontend/src/types/game-systems`) — 10-point registration (`docs/GAME_SYSTEMS.md`), `sheetLimits.ts` byte-parity, derived-value projection, server-side `Keeper's Notes` stripping on Call of Cthulhu 7e, and SRD license compliance.
  - `frontend-reviewer` — React 19 / Vite components, React Query vs Context vs Zustand state boundaries, stale-reply guards, semantic theme tokens (`-ink`), and bundle hygiene.
  - `infra-reviewer` — Docker Compose, Dockerfiles, `nginx/`, `NGINX_CONF_STAMP`, PostgreSQL 18 / Node LTS parity, `.github/workflows/*`, `renovate.json`, `allowScripts`, and Trivy runtime image gates.
- **Always-On Cross-Cutting & Persona Reviewers**:
  - `architecture-reviewer` — Module boundaries, single-owner state layers, cross-package parity (`keepInStep.test.ts`), and `GLOSSARY.md` / ADR alignment.
  - `security-reviewer` — Auth/MFA/session boundaries, server-side RBAC and WebSocket filtering, `Keeper's Notes` privacy, upload validation, secret hygiene, and workflow protection.
  - `spec-parity-reviewer` — 1-to-1 parity between issue/spec acceptance criteria, `routeInventory.test.ts`, `spec-coverage.py`, `websocket-events.py --check`, and the PR diff.
  - `standards-reviewer` — Strict TypeScript (zero `any`), zero lint warnings, semantic theme tokens, parameterized tests, and license notices.
  - `accessibility-reviewer` — WCAG 2.2 AA landmarks, labels, keyboard focus management, and theme contrast across light, dark, custom, and exempt surfaces.
  - `design-reviewer` — `DESIGN.md` semantic tokens, Focus live-table surface rules, and responsive layout integrity (`320px`–`1440px`).
  - `user-advocate` — Persona-driven UX evaluation (`design-gate` and `implementation-review`) across CozyVTT's 4 canonical personas (`DM`, `Player`, `Spectator`, `Administrator / Operator`).

## Path-to-Reviewer Routing

| Changed path or concern | Required reviewers |
| --- | --- |
| `backend/src/routes/**`, `backend/src/services/**`, `backend/src/middleware/**`, `backend/src/validators/**`, `backend/src/config/**`, Prisma-facing backend code, HTTP route tests | `domain-backend-reviewer`, `architecture-reviewer`, `security-reviewer`, `spec-parity-reviewer`, `standards-reviewer`, `user-advocate` |
| `backend/src/websocket/**`, `frontend/src/stores/gameStore.ts`, `frontend/src/components/campaign/map/**`, `frontend/src/services/socket.ts`, vision/parity utilities | `realtime-reviewer`, `architecture-reviewer`, `security-reviewer`, `spec-parity-reviewer`, `standards-reviewer`, `user-advocate` (plus `frontend-reviewer`, `accessibility-reviewer`, `design-reviewer` when UI files change) |
| `backend/src/game-systems/**`, `backend/src/validators/game-systems/**`, `frontend/src/components/character-sheets/**`, `frontend/src/types/game-systems/**`, `sheetLimits.ts` | `game-systems-reviewer`, `architecture-reviewer`, `security-reviewer`, `spec-parity-reviewer`, `standards-reviewer`, `user-advocate` (plus `frontend-reviewer`, `accessibility-reviewer`, `design-reviewer` for sheet UI) |
| `frontend/src/pages/**`, `frontend/src/components/**`, `frontend/src/contexts/**`, `frontend/src/hooks/**`, `frontend/src/services/**`, `frontend/src/themes.ts`, `frontend/src/index.css` | `frontend-reviewer`, `accessibility-reviewer`, `design-reviewer`, `architecture-reviewer`, `security-reviewer`, `spec-parity-reviewer`, `standards-reviewer`, `user-advocate` |
| `docker-compose*`, `Dockerfile*`, `nginx/**`, `scripts/**`, `.github/**`, `renovate.json`, dependency manifests/lockfiles/licence notices | `infra-reviewer`, `architecture-reviewer`, `security-reviewer`, `spec-parity-reviewer`, `standards-reviewer`, `user-advocate` |

